title: "AISend extension for Gemini CLI"
abstract: "AISend is a paid transactional email API built for AI agents to operate and humans to supervise: an agent sends from your verified domain, checks delivery and validates addresses over MCP or a Resend-compatible API, while you approve, review and can revoke access."
